---
title: "UML Sequence Diagram — AI Assistant Question"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as React Client
  participant API as Express API
  participant AS as AssistantService
  participant MS as Market/Explorer Services
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant AI as AI Provider

  U->>FE: Type question (optional txid context)
  FE->>API: POST /api/assistant/chat {message, history, txid?}
  API->>API: auth, CSRF, Zod (≤1000 chars), 20/hour limit
  API->>AS: ask()
  AS->>AS: configured? / seed-phrase or private-key check / daily cap
  alt not configured or secret detected or limit reached
    AS-->>FE: 503 / 400 with clear message
  end
  opt user opted in to share portfolio
    API->>DB: read Portfolio (aggregate numbers only)
  end
  AS->>MS: price, 24h stats, fees, transaction (if txid)
  MS-->>AS: evidence with source + timestamp, missing items
  AS->>AI: system rules + DATA block + question
  alt provider error / quota
    AI-->>AS: 429 / 401 / 5xx
    AS-->>FE: 503 friendly error
  else success
    AI-->>AS: answer text
    AS-->>FE: {answer, evidence[], missing[], dataQuality, model}
    FE-->>U: Answer + evidence panel + data-quality badge
  end
